Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:08.15,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gold Roger, the legendary King of the Pirates,\Nobtained everything the world has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:12.89,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:17.43,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure? Go ahead. Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:19.83,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,Everything is right where I left it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:22.84,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pirates have set out in pursuit of their dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.04,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world has truly entered...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:25.44,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\i1}the Great Pirate Era!
